          "text_en": "Hello {client_title} {client_last_name},<br><br>Thank you for choosing Salt Home.<br><br>While processing your Salt Home service ticket {so_ticket_num}, we would like to offer you our support.<br><br>The Gigabox uses 4G/5G mobile network technology. Speed and performance may be affected by your environment and the location of the equipment.<br><br>Reminder: <b>{giga_gis_device_bold}</b> must be installed outside.<br><br>Please see this video: <a href=\"{giga_gis_video_link}\" target=\"_blank\">{giga_gis_video_link}</a><br><br>Please point your CPE in the direction shown below from the outside:<br><br>***INSERT IMAGE***<br><br>If the problem persists, please send us a speed test using Speedtest by Ookla:<br><br>Android: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.zwanoo.android.speedtest\" target=\"_blank\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.zwanoo.android.speedtest</a><br>IOS: <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/speedtest-by-ookla/id300704847\" target=\"_blank\">https://apps.apple.com/us/app/speedtest-by-ookla/id300704847</a><br>Windows: <a href=\"https://www.speedtest.net/apps/windows\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.speedtest.net/apps/windows</a><br><br>Please also take a photo of your CPE installation and its orientation so that our experts can best assess the situation.<br><br>It is possible to connect to the {giga_gis_device} via the internet to check and improve the signal level.<br><br>In order to access the admin console of your {giga_gis_device}, follow these steps:<br><br>• Make sure your device is connected to the Wi-Fi<br>• Open a browser<br>• Search for 192.168.118.1<br>• Use the logins<br>• {giga_gis_login_line}<br>You will get a coloured diagram that will help you orient your CPE's antenna in the best possible way.<br><br>If you have any questions, please contact us on <b>{agent_phoneNumber}</b> (Mo-Fr from <b>{support_start_time}</b> – <b>{support_end_time}</b>) or simply reply to this email.<br