          "text_en": "Hello {client_title} {client_last_name},<br><br>Thank you for choosing Salt Home.<br><br>We are pleased to assist you regarding your Salt Home service ticket <b>{so_ticket_num}</b>.<br><br>We have carried out the necessary checks and taken the appropriate measures. The measurement results in our system indicate that your service should now be working properly.<br><br>The speed test results from {test_date} show no signs of insufficient speed.<br><br>When a device is connected to the Fiber Box, the achievable transfer rate depends on various factors:<br>1. Device characteristics that affect performance (age of the device, battery condition, memory capacity, etc.)<br>2. Applications running in the background (antivirus, ad blocker, etc.)<br>3. Type of connection (Wi-Fi or cable)<br>4. Internet connection of the Fiber Box (fiber optic technology)<br><br>For additional information about speed, please visit:<br> <a href=\"https://www.salt.ch/en/help/home/internet/speed\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.salt.ch/en/help/home/internet/speed</a><br><br>If you have any questions, please contact us on <b>{agent_phoneNumber}</b> (Mo-Fr from <b>{support_start_time}</b> – <b>{support_end_time}</b>) or simply reply to this email.<br>You can also find answers to frequently asked questions at <a href=\"https://www.salt.ch/en/help/home\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.salt.ch/en/help/home</a>.<br><br>Thank you very much.<br>{agent_firstName} from your Salt Home Team",
          "text_de": "Guten Tag {client_title} {client_last_name},<br><br>vielen Dank, dass Sie sich für Salt Home entschieden haben.<br><br>Gerne helfen wir Ihnen bei Ihrem Salt Home Service Ticket <b>{so_ticket_num}</b>.<br><br>Wir haben Untersuchungen durchgeführt und die notwendigen Massnahmen ergriffen. Die Messergebnisse in unserem System zeigen, dass Ihr Service nun funktionieren sollte.<br><br>Die Ergebnisse des Speedtests vom {test_date} zeigen keine unzureichende Geschwindigkeit.<br><br>Wenn ein Gerät an die Fiber Box angeschlossen wird, hängt die erreichbare Übertragungsrate von verschiedenen Faktoren ab:<br>1. Geräteeigenschaften, die die Leistung beeinflussen (Alter des Geräts, Zustand des Akkus, Arbeitsspeicher etc.)<br>2. Im Hintergrund laufende Anwendungen (Antivirus, Werbeblocker etc.)<br>3. Art der Verbindung (WLAN oder Kabel)<br>4. Internetverbindung der Fiber Box (Glasfasertechnologie)<br><br>Weitere Informationen zur Geschwindigkeit finden Sie unter:<br><a href=\"https://www.salt.ch/de/help/home/internet/speed\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.salt.ch/de/help/home/internet/speed</a><br><br>Wenn Sie Fragen haben, können Sie uns unter <b>{agent_phoneNumber}</b> (Mo-Fr von <b>{support_start_time}</b> – <b>{support_end_time}</b> Uhr) erreichen oder auf diese E-Mail antworten.<br>Antworten auf häufig gestellte Fragen finden Sie auch unter <a href=\"https://www.salt.ch/de/help/home\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.salt.ch/de/help/home</a>.<br><br>Vielen Dank.<br>{agent_firstName} von Ihrem Salt Home Team",
          "text_it": "Salve {client_title} {client_last_name},<br><br>grazie per aver scelto Salt Home.<br><br>Siamo lieti di assisterla in merito al suo ticket di servizio Salt Home <b>{so_ticket_num}</b>.<br><br>Abbiamo effettuato le verifiche necessarie e adottato le misure opportune. I risultati delle rilevazioni nel nostro sistema indicano che il servizio dovrebbe ora funzionare correttamente.<br><br>I risultati dello speed test del {test_date} non mostrano segni di velocità insufficiente.<br><br>\nQuando un dispositivo è collegato alla Fiber Box, la velocità di trasmissione raggiungibile dipende da diversi fattori:<br>1. Caratteristiche del dispositivo che influiscono sulle prestazioni (età del dispositivo, stato della batteria, memoria, ecc.)<br>2. Applicazioni in esecuzione in background (antivirus, ad blocker, ecc.)<br>\n3. Tipo di connessione (Wi-Fi o cavo)<br>4. Connessione Internet della Fiber Box (tecnologia in fibra ottica)<br><br>\nPer ulteriori informazioni sulla velocità, visiti:<br><a href=\"https://www.salt.ch/it/help/home/internet/speed\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.salt.ch/it/help/home/internet/speed</a><br><br>Per qualsiasi domanda, ci contatti al numero <b>{agent_phoneNumber}</b> (lun-ven: <b>{support_start_time}</b> – <b>{support_end_time}</b>) o risponda semplicemente a quest’e-mail.<br>Troverà inoltre le risposte alle domande frequenti su <a href=\"https://www.salt.ch/it/help/home\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.salt.ch/it/help/home</a>.<br><br>Grazie.<br>{agent_firstName} dal vostro team Salt Home",
